      "ordered_branches": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "explanation": "Collects distinct order IDs joined through details to shipments on the load. Removes any order having any shipment detail anywhere with status1<900; other status buckets and NULL status1 are not tested. Unordered status-flow lookup for status900/fixed functional area provides external condition, potentially NULL if absent. Updates eligible ORDER_HEADER condition and UTC condition time, then every ORDER_DETAIL condition for those orders. No shipping-load status validation or transaction across both updates.",
